func Load(path string) (*Config, error)
func (c *Config) Validate() error
func (c *Config) SetDefaults()
```

**Validation:**
- Config loads from TOML
- Validation catches errors
- Defaults applied correctly
- Example configs load successfully
- Test coverage >= 85%

