| **Error Handling** | Ad-hoc per component | Phase 0.2 (unified framework) |
| **Logging** | Priority 2 add-on | Phase 0.3 (built-in from start) |
| **Config** | Phase 6 (late) | Phase 0.4 (foundation) |
| **Context** | Not mentioned | Phase 0.6 (foundation) |
| **Shutdown** | Ad-hoc | Phase 0.8 (coordinated) |
