| **First Test Written** | Phase 7 | Day 1 (Phase 0.5) |
| **Test-First Mandate** | No | Yes (every task) |
| **Rework Risk** | 70% | 15% |
| **Success Probability** | 30% | 85% |
| **Foundation Quality** | Shaky | Rock-solid |

