## Risk Assessment

### Old Plan Risk: VERY HIGH (70% rework probability)

Why:
- Tests last → design flaws discovered late
- Interfaces during implementation → breaking changes
- No unified patterns → inconsistent codebase

### New Plan Risk: MEDIUM (15% rework probability)

Why:
- Phase 0 invests upfront → catches issues early
- Test-first → validates design immediately
- Unified patterns → consistent codebase

**Mitigation:** Strict adherence to test-first development and quality gates

